      "agent_response": "I have noted your project progress for this week:\n- **Frontend Development:** 75% completed\n- **Bugs Fixed:** 12\n- **Unit Tests Written:** 3\n\nHere is the updated list of everything I am keeping track of for you:\n\n**1. Project Progress (This Week):**\n- 75% of frontend development completed\n- 12 bugs fixed\n- 3 unit tests written\n\n**2. Work Hours:**\n- Monday: 8.5 hours\n- Tuesday: 7 hours\n- Wednesday: 9 hours\n\n**3. Study Hours:**\n- Monday: 3 hours\n- Tuesday: 4 hours\n- Wednesday: 2.5 hours\n\n**4. Expenses (This Week):**\n- Groceries: $450\n- Gas: $120\n\n**5. Hydration (Today):**\n- Water: 6 glasses (48 ounces total)\n\nWhenever you're ready, just let me know if you'd like me to email this list to you or save it as a draft so you have a permanent record!",
