nced Research team at Texas Instruments. We've been following your recent work and are very interested in exploring potential collaboration opportunities on an upcoming research project.\n\nIf you're open to it, I'd appreciate the chance to schedule a call next week to discuss how our teams might work together.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nTim\nTexas Instruments\n",
